WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:10.577
[tapping on glass]

00:00:12.978 --> 00:00:16.916
- WAS I SPEEDING, OFFICER?

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:18.151
- YOU DON'T LOOK LIKE
YOU'RE FROM AROUND HERE.

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:20.653
- NO, SIR.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:24.090
- YOU BEEN DOING
ANY DRUGS TONIGHT?

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:25.525
- NO, SIR.

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:30.229
- NOPE?
- NO.

00:00:30.262 --> 00:00:32.065
- WHY DON'T YOU
POP THAT TRUNK,

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:33.633
STEP OUT OF THE VEHICLE
FOR ME, PLEASE.

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.935
- REALLY?
- YEAH.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.238
[trunk pops]

00:00:39.271 --> 00:00:39.606
- [sighs]
[seatbelt clicks]

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:44.343
- NO DRUGS, HUH?

00:00:44.376 --> 00:00:47.613
- NOPE.
[indistinct radio chatter]

00:00:47.646 --> 00:00:52.452
- WELL, WELL, WELL.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:54.654
[trunk closes]
WHAT HAVE WE HERE?

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:57.757
- NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO.
YOU PLANTED THAT IN MY CAR.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.992
- OH, DID I?

00:01:00.025 --> 00:01:02.929
OR...DID I PLANT THIS?

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:05.198
- UH--I REAL--I GUESS--

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:06.766
- UP AGAINST THE CAR,
RIGHT NOW.

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:08.434
- OH!
- SPREAD 'EM!

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:10.303
- UH--
- HUH, WHAT'S GOING--

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:12.105
WHOA, WHOA.
WHAT DO WE HAVE HERE, HUH?

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:13.840
- WHAT?
- THESE YOUR COLORS, HOMIE?

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:15.741
- THAT'S--THAT'S NOT MINE.
- HUH?

00:01:15.774 --> 00:01:17.043
- NO, I DON'T KNOW WHAT THAT--
- WHAT? NO?

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:18.811
OR ARE THESE YOUR COLORS?

00:01:18.844 --> 00:01:21.414
OR PERHAPS THESE
ARE YOUR COLORS.

00:01:21.447 --> 00:01:23.216
OR ARE THESE--?
LOOK AT ALL THESE COLORS.

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:25.118
MAN, YOU SURE GOT
A LOT OF COLORS.

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:26.853
- I DON'T--
- LOOK AT ALL OF THESE COLORS.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.154
- WHAT, THIS IS--

00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:30.657
- WASAH!

00:01:33.225 --> 00:01:35.328
- ARE YOU A REAL COP?
- FREEZE!

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.230
WHAT IS THAT?
- WHAT--

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:38.531
- MM.

00:01:38.564 --> 00:01:40.800
WELL, WELL, WELL.

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:43.669
IT LOOKS LIKE
AN ILLEGAL FIREARM.

00:01:43.702 --> 00:01:46.439
OR...

00:01:46.472 --> 00:01:48.407
IS IT? AHH.
[dove cooing]

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:49.909
- OH.

00:01:54.346 --> 00:01:56.249
I'M--I DON'T--
I DON'T KNOW WHAT THIS IS.

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:57.950
I'M SORRY.
- PICK A CARD.

00:01:57.983 --> 00:02:00.119
- THAT'S NOT EVEN A GOOD FAN.

00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:02.088
- ANY CARD.
YOU CAN JUST STICK--THERE.

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:03.856
OKAY, YOU TOOK THAT CARD?
- YEAH.

00:02:03.889 --> 00:02:04.790
- NOW, CAN YOU
REMEMBER THAT CARD?

00:02:04.823 --> 00:02:06.626
- YES.

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:08.561
- CAN YOU COMMIT THAT CARD
TO MEMORY?

00:02:08.594 --> 00:02:10.163
- THIS IS UNBELIEVABLE.
- HAVE YOU DONE SO?

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:12.265
HAVE YOU DONE SO?
- YES.

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:13.232
- PLEASE INSERT THE CARD BACK
INTO THE DECK RANDOMLY.

00:02:13.265 --> 00:02:15.468
- DONE.

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:17.703
- IT'S IN A DIFFERENT PLACE THAN
WHERE YOU TOOK IT ORIGINALLY?

00:02:17.736 --> 00:02:20.039
- THERE.
- THERE WE ARE. THERE WE ARE.

00:02:20.072 --> 00:02:23.676
- THIS IS RIDICULOUS.
- NOW, I TAKE THE DECK LIKE SO.

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:26.613
I GIVE IT A "SKASLOISLES"
AND "ABRACASLOISH."

00:02:28.881 --> 00:02:32.118
[gunshot]
- UH, FU--WHA--

00:02:32.151 --> 00:02:36.122
- OKAY...

00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:39.559
AHH.
IS THIS YOUR CARD?

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:41.327
- NO!
- ARE YOU SURE?

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:42.662
- I WANT YOUR BADGE NUMBER.

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:44.697
[coughing]

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:46.633
- OH. OH. OH!

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:51.370
- [coughing]

00:02:51.403 --> 00:02:56.509
UH--UH--WHA--
WHAT DID--

00:02:56.542 --> 00:02:57.610
OH!
- HAAH.

00:02:57.643 --> 00:02:59.545
- HOW DID--

00:02:59.578 --> 00:03:01.214
IT'S MY CA--
HOW DID YOU DO THAT?

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:04.617
- AHH.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:06.352
AND...

00:03:06.385 --> 00:03:10.289
THAT IS FOR YOU.

00:03:10.322 --> 00:03:12.558
- AFTER ALL THAT,
YOU'RE STILL GIVING ME A TICKET?

00:03:12.591 --> 00:03:14.760
- IS IT A TICKET?

00:03:14.793 --> 00:03:18.598
OR IS IT A TWO-FOR-ONE COUPON
FOR MY SHOW

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:20.600
AT THE MAGIC HOUSE
THURSDAY NIGHT AT 11:00 P.M.?

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:23.102
YOUR CALL.

00:03:26.705 --> 00:03:28.808
- I'LL TAKE THE TICKET.

00:03:28.841 --> 00:03:29.809
- GREAT. OKAY.

